{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中電在元朗水邊圍邨一帶，有地底電纜故障，約2,400戶電力供應受影響，預計早上十時完成維修。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中電發言人指，事發在凌晨4時許，工程人員正搶修，包括調動臨時發電機及鋪設臨時電纜，中電支援隊已到場為受影響院舍，提供流動電池作應急支援，並與當區民政事務處及區議員緊密溝通。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CLP-0930_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20263JgF0K3wxZ1786412603.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CLP-0930_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T01:52:27.884404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}